OL,3,GNEWSAFort Regent could lose roof under 
OL,4,Arevamp plans                           
OL,6,FPlans to remove Fort Regent's roof are 
OL,7,Fbeing considered, according to Jersey's
OL,8,Feconomic development minister.         
OL,10,FOfficials previously announced         
OL,11,Fredevelopment plans for the fort, in St
OL,12,FHelier, would be re-examined after     
OL,13,Foverall costs rose beyond the #110m    
OL,14,Festimate.                              
OL,16,FDeputy Gerald Voisin told a public     
OL,17,Fscrutiny meeting that removing the roof
OL,18,Fwas among several options being        
OL,19,Fexplored by a steering group. It comes 
OL,20,Fafter #43m was already approved for    
OL,21,Frepair works.                          
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
