OL,3,GNEWSAFort Regent could lose roof under 
OL,4,Arevamp plans                           
OL,6,FMinister for Infrastructure Deputy     
OL,7,FJonathan Renouf said there was a clear 
OL,8,Fneed to deal with the "significant     
OL,9,Finvestment required after many years of
OL,10,Funder-investment in the building".     
